  "description": "At the Round Table, suspicions predominantly fell on Hannah (for hesitating to take shields and for not being murdered). She was banished by a near unanimous vote with both Maya and James A. voting for her. She revealed she was a Traitor to the delight of the Faithful.Afterwards, some suspicion fell on Joanne after she unintentionally implied she had been at the face to face murder. Joe openly begged every player for the Traitors to recruit him now that a spot was available. That night, the Traitors decided to recruit either Joanne, Kenny, or Joe. They chose Kenny and he accepted the offer.",
